invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305_scalar.h
catches: poly1305_equiv_test
reason: carry_scalar hands back the vector path's accumulator after
  one pass of carries, so h1 can reach 2^26 + 2^10, past the at most
  2^26 poly1305_vector.h states. The value modulo 2^130 - 5 is still right, so every tag
  matches, and poly1305.c's loop and final carry would absorb the excess
  today; the contract is what keeps the next reader of the accumulator
  inside the bounds poly1305.c's proof explored. bin/poly1305_equiv_test
  checks each word after every direct call.

--- old
    h[1] = (uint32_t)h1 & WORD_MASK;
    h2 += (uint32_t)(h1 >> 26);
--- new
    h[1] = (uint32_t)h1;
